The room in which you find yourself attests to the skill of its builder. It
is dominated by a central floor with a podium, which appears to be crafted
of the purest crystal, and it hums softly with a resonating frequency that 
compels you to listen to whoever is currently utilizing it.  Surrounding this
podium on all four sides are majestic benches with plush chairs for the deities
which sometimes occupy them.  On the fourth side of the podium and floor are 
rows upon rows of chairs, obviously in place for a large audience to witness
the meetings of the divine. 

